{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26017","headline":"代楚老酬主人 · 鲍溶","name":"代楚老酬主人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"流水爲我乡，扁舟爲我宅。\n二毛去天远，几日人间客。\n曈曈衔山景，渺渺翔云迹。\n从时无定心，病处不煖席。\n烦君问岐路，爲我生凄慽。\n百年衣食身，未死皆有役。\n曾伤无遗嗣，纵有复何益。\n终古北邙山，樵人卖松栢。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"鲍溶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26017.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26017","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}